    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We at Felicity Fox are delighted to introduce this bright and spacious top-floor, three-bedroom apartment, ideally positioned within walking distance of Dublin city centre. The property also benefits from two secure, designated car parking spaces—a rare advantage in such a central location.\r\nThe well-appointed south-westerly facing apartment comprises an inviting entrance hall with hot press, a generous living/dining room with access to the balcony, a fully equipped kitchen, three sizeable bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, and two modern bathrooms.\r\nLocated in the highly-regarded Malthouse development, this quiet residential enclave is set within a well-maintained development featuring secure underground parking, landscaped communal areas and a responsive management company.\r\nResidents are within easy reach of the city centre, St James’s Hospital, the Coombe Hospital, and the New Children’s Hospital. Excellent transport connections include the nearby Luas Red Line, Dublin Bus routes, and Heuston Station.\r\nNestled in the vibrant Dublin 8 suburbs, this spacious apartment offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy city living in one of Dublin’s most dynamic neighborhoods. The area is well served by supermarkets, independent cafés, gyms and pilates studios, with the bustling Camden Street, Newmarket Square, and the Guinness Quarter all within walking distance. With its prime location and excellent amenities, this home provides a comfortable base in a convenient, thriving part of Dublin."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway                                        \t6.58 * 0.96\r\nLaminate wood floor. Intercom to front door. Shelved hot press.\r\n\r\nLiving Room                               \t5.59 * 3.94 + 3.1 * 1.87\r\nLaminate wood floor. Fitted shelfing. Fitted wardrobes. TV point. Sliding door to balcony\r\n\r\nKitchen                                         \t3.1 * 2\r\nTiled floor. Fully fitted floor units. Stainless steel sink unit. Electric oven + Hob. Kenwood fridge freezer. Hotpoint Oven, Hob. Extractor fan. Zanussi Dishwasher. Zanussi Washing Machine\r\n\r\nBedroom 1                                  \t3 .25 * 3.35\r\nLaminate wood floor. Built in wardrobes. Recess lighting \r\nEnsuite                                         \t2.1 * 1\r\nFully tiled. Wash hand basin. WC. Shower cubicle. Fitted shelfing. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2                                  \t4.27 * 2.36\r\nLaminate wood floor. Built in wardrobes. Recess lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3                                  \t2.98 * 2.36\r\nLaminate wood floor. Built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom                                    \t2.34 * 1.39\r\nFully tiled. Bath with shower. WC. Wash hand basin. Extractor fan\r\n\r\nBalcony                                        \t14.7 * 0.5\r\nPaved, Westerly Aspect."
